Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:58:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] PixelOS: Add status bar lyric text conversion option

Adds a dropdown below the status bar lyric toggle in Display settings
to convert lyrics between Simplified and Traditional Chinese
(follow original / always Simplified / always Traditional), backed by
Settings.Secure.STATUS_BAR_LYRIC_TEXT_CONVERSION. Includes zh-rCN
translations. SystemUI observes the setting live and the mode takes
effect from the next lyric line.

Change-Id: I69a2cd65c869c5647e9976feb3c143a860e758ee
